      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The source of the issue seems to be that the Ultra quality settings are missing from EnvConfig.cs (com.vrchat.base\\Editor\\VRCSDK\\Dependencies\\VRChat\\EnvConfig.cs) and the function that overrides the Unity graphics settings with VRC's presets will set them to the 4th entry (which was previously Ultra and now Mobile).",
