      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name} I don't know if the missing Ultra is expected behavior of VRCSDK but if it's expected, I think this canny can be closed since the \"defaults to VRC Mobile\" problem has been resolved in VRCSDK 3.3.0.",
